Wraper calsses  provide an object representation 
of primitive values.

they will also provide useful for working with those values.






byte  -Byte
short   -Short
Int  - Integer
long - Long
double - Double
float -Float
char  - Character
boolean -Boolean


ex: to convert primitive to an object 
int v=10//primitive 
Integer 




Auto boxing :
=============
automatic conversion of primitive type to wrapper class object type.
ex: 
int->Integer
byte->Byte



AutoUnboxung or UnBoxing:
========================

automatic conversion of wrapper class object type into primitive type

ex: 
          Integer -> int
          Byte    -> byte























